  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="29">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 29</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="29" corresp="#wit-d">And gif he his lif misfadige, wanige his weorðscipe be þam þe seo dæd sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-d">And if he misdirects his life, his privileges shall be reduced, according to the nature of the offence.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und wenn er sein Leben unordentlich führt, schwinde sein Ehrenrang, je nachdem die That ist.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And if he leads his life badly, let his honour diminish, according to what the deed is.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares VI Atr 5.4.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
